The story of the meteoric rise and catastrophic
demise of the world's first smartphone.

5
00:26:05,217 --> 00:26:11,217
Mike Lazaridis, played by Jay Baruchel.

6
00:31:18,260 --> 00:31:24,260
Jim Balsillie, played by Glenn Howerton.

7
00:36:31,304 --> 00:36:37,304
Doug Fregin, played by Matt Johnson.

